{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.poster.avif?t=1761381682\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.webm?t=1761381682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.mp4?t=1761381682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Claviator</strong> is a rhythm-based adventure that brings a fresh spin to music games. Guided by the charismatic and experienced <strong>Claviator</strong>, your musical companion, you and your friends will journey through a variety of themed worlds, playing along to a wide selection of songs, from familiar favorites to original tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional rhythm games that keep you locked in place, <i>Claviator</i> lets you <strong>move freely through 3D environments</strong> while staying in sync with the beat. Whether you\u2019re playing solo, teaming up in co-op, or facing off in PvP, Claviator blends rhythm mechanics with movement and multiplayer interaction for a fun and flexible experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>story-driven challenges</strong>, battle it out in <strong>five distinct PvP modes</strong>, and choose between <strong>4-note or 8-note input systems</strong> to match your skill level and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Animals</strong> test your sense of timing!\u00a0Time your moves across three buttons and hit <strong>Space</strong> to land the perfect note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.poster.avif?t=1761381682\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.webm?t=1761381682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.mp4?t=1761381682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Gameplay with Freedom to Move</strong>:\u00a0Hit notes in time while exploring fully 3D worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore While You Play</strong>:\u00a0Walk, jump, and interact with environments as you progress through each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Music Library</strong>:\u00a0Play a variety of well-known songs and original compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>:\u00a0Team up with friends or compete head-to-head in 5 unique PvP game types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode with Claviator</strong>:\u00a0Join your guide on a lighthearted journey through musical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Input Options</strong>:\u00a0Choose between 4-note or 8-note control setups for an accessible or more advanced rhythm experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re aiming for a high score, progressing through story quests, or just playing casually with friends, <strong>Claviator\u00a0</strong>offers a rhythm experience that\u2019s both creative and approachable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705340?t=1761381682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705340?t=1761381682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/113e0a43174a98e289c5d72eb18f74476fcf5000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761381682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/113e0a43174a98e289c5d72eb18f74476fcf5000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761381682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4118990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.poster.avif?t=1761381682\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.webm?t=1761381682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.mp4?t=1761381682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Claviator</strong> is a rhythm-based adventure that brings a fresh spin to music games. Guided by the charismatic and experienced <strong>Claviator</strong>, your musical companion, you and your friends will journey through a variety of themed worlds, playing along to a wide selection of songs, from familiar favorites to original tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional rhythm games that keep you locked in place, <i>Cla