itions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>:\u00a0Team up with friends or compete head-to-head in 5 unique PvP game types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode with Claviator</strong>:\u00a0Join your guide on a lighthearted journey through musical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Input Options</strong>:\u00a0Choose between 4-note or 8-note control setups for an accessible or more advanced rhythm experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re aiming for a high score, progressing through story quests, or just playing casually with friends, <strong>Claviator\u00a0</strong>offers a rhythm experience that\u2019s both creative and approachable.</p>","developers":["Zero Inches"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/9c55b5c86344c56ac197a11f3741d1cce51593ad/header.jpg?t=1761381682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 (Sequoia)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3705340/845788746/28351b761687d008dbf1cbf89e470db0ebc0b50c/1760537297/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760537872","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3705340/845788746/28351b761687d008dbf1cbf89e470db0ebc0b50c/1760537297/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760537872","highlight":true,"